SEED_EXIT=0
```
Attack markdown `/tmp/qa-a/bad.md`:
```
Bogus claim [VERIFIED: sha256:ee656fb6...0f14b "purple elephant parades loudly"] noted.
```
Result:
```
$ bun ./packages/cli/src/bin.ts audit-research --markdown /tmp/qa-a/bad.md \
    --cache-dir /tmp/qa-a/cache --state-dir /tmp/qa-a/state
